flowchart LR
    C[Concurrent HTTP clients] --> A[FastAPI /v1/generate]
    A --> Q{Bounded admission queue}
    Q -->|full| O[HTTP 429]
    Q -->|accepted| B[Prompt-length bucket]
    B --> D{Dispatch trigger}
    D -->|bucket reaches max_batch_size| G[Batch generation]
    D -->|oldest reaches max_wait_ms| G
    G --> T[Pad + tokenize together]
    T --> M[One model.generate call]
    M --> R[Correlate output futures by request ID]
    R --> A
    A --> C
    G --> X[Latency, tokens, padding, errors]
